<title>USA: Oneida Cty, N.Y., won by PaineWebber Inc..</title>
<headline>Oneida Cty, N.Y., won by PaineWebber Inc..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said it won $11.873 million of Oneida County, N.Y., unlimited tax public improvement serial bonds, series 1997 with a net interest cost of 5.592 percent.</p>
</text>
